    "new_evidence_required": "Promotion needs a shared default-off clean-flow quality-gate helper (admit liquid candidates only when the PIT short_volume_ratio percentile is below the toxic quintile) wired into historical replay AND a daily default-off snapshot with a parity test, then a full-stack candidate-pool Gate 1-4 overlay that must beat the closest accepted comparator after costs, concentration, and drawdown -- or materially more closed forward rows tagged with the entry-time short_volume_ratio percentile."
  },
